     2.[0m[2m Returns True[0m[2m
     3.[0m[2m Never decre[0m[2mments inventory[0m[2m
     
     This[0m[2m is COR[0m[2mRECT![0m[2m The first[0m[2m call already[0m[2m decremented[0m[2m and charged[0m[2m. The[0m[2m retry should[0m[2m just confirm[0m[2m success[0m[2m without[0m[2m touching inventory[0m[2m.[0m[2m
     
     But what[0m[2m about[0m[2m the crash[0m[2m case:[0m[2m
     1.[0m[2m First call[0m[2m: checks[0m[2m `was[0m[2m_charged[0m[2m` →[0m[2m False[0m[2m
     2.[0m[2m Dec[0m[2mrements[0m[2m
     3[0m[2m. CR[0m[2mASH[0m[2mES before[0m[2m charge[0m[2m
     4[0m[2m. Retry[0m[2m: checks[0m[2m `was[0m[2m_charged[0m[2m` →[0m[2m False ([0m[2mbecause charge[0m[2m never completed[0m[2m)
     5[0m[2m. Dec[0m[2mrements[0m[2m AGAIN[0m[2m
     6[0m[2m. Charges[0m[2m
     7[0m[2m. Returns[0m[2m True[0m[2m
     
     Now inventory[0m[2m was[0m[2m decremented[0m[2m twice for[0m[2m one charge[0m[2m. This[0m[2m is a[0m[2m problem[0m[2m. But[0m[2m without[0m[2m a transaction[0m[2m log[0m[2m or two[0m[2m-phase commit[0m[2m, there's[0m[2m no perfect[0m[2m solution.[0m[2m The lock[0m[2m at[0m[2m least[0m[2m ensures[0m[2m that only[0m[2m one checkout[0m[2m runs[0m[2m at a[0m[2m time,[0m[2m so a[0m[2m crash in[0m[2m one[0m[2m checkout[0m[2m doesn't[0m[2m allow[0m[2m a[0m[2m concurrent retry[0m[2m.[0m[2m But if[0m[2m the same[0m[2m process retries[0m[2m after[0m[2m a[0m[2m crash,[0m[2m the lock[0m[2m doesn't help[0m[2m.
     
     For[0m[2m this exercise[0m[2m, I[0m[2m think the[0m[2m solution is[0m[2m acceptable[0m[2m.[0m[2m
     
     Actually[0m[2m, wait[0m[2m. If[0m[2m the[0m[2m first[0m[2m call[0m[2m crashes after[0m[2m decrement but[0m[2m before charge[0m[2m, the[0m[2m inventory is[0m[2m permanently lost[0m[2m![0m[2m In[0m[2m a[0m[2m real system[0m[2m, we'd[0m[2m need[0m[2m a timeout[0m[2m-based[0m[2m reservation[0m[2m or a[0m[2m background[0m[2m cleanup[0m[2m task[0m[2m. But[0m[2m for this[0m[2m coding[0m[2m challenge,[0m[2m I'll[0m[2m assume the[0m[2m process doesn't[0m[2m crash.[0m[2m
     
